Organization = {SPIE},
Abstract = {Based on the current land uses of 2005 and 2015 in Dongying District,
   this study obtained the spatial-temporal variation matrix of land use of
   the two periods with the overlay function in ArcGIS 10.2. The analysis
   results showed as follows: (1)Agricultural area decrease a little.
   (2)The urban land area had increased grately. (3)Coastal aquaculture
   area increase a lot. Their main driving factors were: (1)The policy of
   farmland protection was carried out in Dongying. (2)The economic in
   Dongying District has developed rapidly in recent 10 years. (3)The
   landuse is often driven by higher economic profits. The conclusions were
   meaningful for the reform of land use structure and the reform of
   economic structure in the future in Dongying City.},
