   BEEUE; Int Clean Energy Talent Program; UNiLAB},
Abstract = {With the continuous improvement of green building theory in recent years
   and the continuous development of low-carbon building technology
   practice,residential building has become to one of the most fundamental
   building forms.The sustainable green concept becomes the inevitable
   trend of its future development. People who live in Huizhou,the old name
   of Anhui province, have created the traditional residential houses
   regional characteristics. In the process has accumulated a lot of
   harmonious symbiosis with nature according to the unique local
   conditions.And because of the limit of the ancient construction makes
   the technical level of residential areas looks simple and crude in the
   mordern word.The traditional residential houses still have some room for
   improvement. The study takes a local village ``Hongcun{''} Typical
   residential house as an example.And the model were set up to simulate
   the annual temperature and humidity and energy consumption of the
   residential house. The research shows that through proper passive
   retrofitting measures energy consumption could be effectively saved and
   indoor thermal environment could be well constructed. Copyright (C) 2018
