   good society. The fact remains that if we eliminate all the cities from
   this continent, what remains is not much. In fact, even though we
   Americans tend to be very sceptical about the presence of the city, we
   must recognize that the City is still the place where things are
   happening in scale and in quality which is very real otherwise.{''}
