   Management},
Abstract = {Coal mining affects around environment to varying degree,. especially
   water resource more and more serious. Water environment of the mining
   district is influenced by many factors and recent study on the waste
   water source and the influence is still not profound enough. At the same
   time water quality evaluation has more qualitative analysis, less
   quantitative calculation and the mathematical model is not accurate
   enough, so it is difficult to find the objective conclusion. Based on
   the technological condition of the coal mining and the water environment
   characteristics of the mining district, fuzzy synthesis evaluation is
   used as the evaluation model. On the principle of independence, easily
   obtained, comparability, pertinence and so on, five indexes, mine water,
   coal-cleaning waste water, sanitary waste water and coal gangue leached
   water and others, are selected as the water quality evaluation index
   sunset, to form the water quality evaluation index system on above
   factors. The evaluation degree of every factors is defined using fuzzy
   synthesis evaluation method, which is used to put forward the focus
   prevention method to protect the water environment and guard the water
   quality.},
