Note = {4th International Conference of Young Scientists (COYOUS 2011), Prague,
   CZECH REPUBLIC, APR 28, 2011},
Organization = {Czech Univ Life Sci Prague, Fac Forestry \& Wood Sci},
Abstract = {In the course of chipless cutting of wood with a wedge tool in a
   direction against the fiber texture large cutting forces come into
   being. Hence the cutting process requires great energy consumption.
   Chipless delimbing is one of the specific cases of this cutting process.
   On the score of largeness energetic slope and value delimbing
   (expurgation xylem stuff trunk from limb) there is very important
   analysis of cutting forces in the delimbing process. The paper shows
   investigation and influence on chosen technological parameters of
   machine delimbing to improve the process of the cutting of bough and
   increase of machine qualities of delimbing during tree manipulation. The
   intent of this paper is evaluation of influence on individual aspects at
   cutting force with keeping to the terms of delimbing.},
