Title = {DIFFERENCES IN THE PERSONAL AUTONOMY OF THE EXECUTIVE-DECISIONAL
   FUNCTIONS AND THOSE OF A MAINLY EXECUTIVE NATURE, WITHIN THE RAILROAD
   TRANSPORT RISK-INVOLVING SITUATIONS},
